<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<%- include('../partials/header') %>
<main id="main"><div class="shell"><section class="section">
  <h1 class="section__title">Code of Conduct</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <h3>How this replica was built</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Only publicly accessible pages were retrieved, by following links from the site&rsquo;s
      own navigation.</li>
      <li>No form was submitted to the original. No account was created. No CAPTCHA was
      solved or bypassed. No authentication was attempted.</li>
      <li>No endpoint was enumerated, fuzzed or probed, and no credential, session token or
      cookie was recorded.</li>
      <li>Requests were made one at a time with a delay between them, so the original was
      never put under load.</li>
      <li>TLS certificate verification was enabled for every request.</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>The original&rsquo;s own code of conduct</h3>
    <p>The original portal forbids accounts created by bots, crawlers or automated programs.
    This project creates no account anywhere and respects that rule.</p>
  </div>
</section></div></main>
